    "details": "The Pillow project published security advisories for issues fixed in\nrelease 13.0.0. They include an argument injection in the Ghostscript\ncall used for EPS images, heap buffer overflows in several image\ndecoders that can lead to code execution, and infinite loops and\nunbounded memory use when opening crafted image files.\n",
